Ok, I'm at my desk now.

Yeah, tested again. That issue is fixed by the logic below:
```cpp
	Point2i start_pos = start_rect.position;
	if (start_pos.x != -1 && selection_from_column > 0) {
		start_pos.x += start_rect.size.x;
	}
```

When start is the first char, then `selection_from_column` would be 0 and rect size won't be added to it. So it seems correct to me.

