body:
The hovered gutter shouldn't be set since on touch release it isn't actually being hovered. This results in tapping a breakpoint to remove it drawing the hovered breakpoint. It does need the signal though.

```suggestion
			if (current_hovered_gutter != Vector2i(-1, -1)) {
				emit_signal(SNAME("gutter_clicked"), current_hovered_gutter.y, current_hovered_gutter.x);
```

